{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34186","headline":"感事 · 陆龟蒙","name":"感事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军被鲛函，祗畏金石镞。\n岂知谗箭利，一中成赤族。\n古来信簧舌，巧韵凄锵曲。\n君闻悦耳音，尽日听不足。\n初因起毫髪，渐可离骨肉。\n所以贤达心，求人须任目。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}